## english description of PELITA
PELITA — English Description: 🌐
"PELITA (Penerang Literasi Kesehatan) is a web-based educational game designed for Indonesian teenagers. It teaches 12 WHO health literacy indicators through interactive narratives featuring Javanese wayang characters Nakula and Sadewa. The game is free, requires no installation, and can be played on any device with internet access. PELITA uses a 'Cinema Mode' interface with dark backgrounds to enhance focus, and applies positive reinforcement principles where players are never penalized for wrong answers."

