English tagline: 💡
- "Learn Health, Play Games."
- "Health Literacy Made Fun."
- "Your Health, Your Adventure."
- "Play, Learn, and Grow Healthy."
- "Enlightening Health Literacy."

## english elevator pitch
English elevator pitch: ⏱️
"PELITA is a web-based educational game for Indonesian teenagers. It teaches 12 WHO health literacy indicators through interactive stories featuring Javanese wayang characters Nakula and Sadewa. The game is free, requires no installation, and can be played on any device. Created by a junior high school student for the LKIP XIII 2026 competition."

