- Faskes: Fasilitas Kesehatan.
- Rujukan: Referral ke RS.
- PELITA mengajarkan pentingnya ke puskesmas dulu.

## istilah wayang, wayang terms
Istilah wayang: 🎭
- Wayang: Traditional Javanese puppet.
- Dalang: Puppeteer.
- Gamelan: Traditional music ensemble.
- Nakula: One of Pandawa brothers.
- Sadewa: Twin brother of Nakula.
- Pandawa: Five brothers in Mahabharata.
- UNESCO: Acknowledged wayang as heritage in 2003.

